{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":2865566,"ns":0,"title":"Cycloid gear","extract":"A cycloidal gear is a toothed gear with a cycloidal profile. Such gears are used in mechanical clocks and watches, rather than the involute gear form used for most other gears.","description":"Toothed gear based on epicycloids and hypocycloids","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}